"about":"Veocode is a Mac app for working with several AIs on several projects at once. The interface (SolidJS) shows the projects, the conversations and the code; the Rust engine (Tauri) runs Claude Code and the API-based AIs, reads what they do and takes care of files, git and the terminal.",
